<div>
<div>
<p>If you&rsquo;re looking for a Bachelor's degree programme at a Top 100 University in the Netherland&rsquo;s most vibrant college towns, you&rsquo;ve come to the right place. Known for its international vibe and world-class research, the University of Groningen offers over 35 English-taught Bachelor's degree programmes across 11 faculties. We&rsquo;ve been helping to shape innovative minds for over 400 years. Find out what the University of Groningen can do for you. &nbsp;</p>
