<div class="rug-media__body">
<div class="rug-text-timid rug-mb-xxs">09 September 2026 - Abibat</div>
<h3 class="rug-h5">
<a href="/education/student-blog/12-essentials-in-my-uni-bag">12 Essentials in My Uni Bag</a>
</h3>
<div>
<p>Packing your bag for uni means deciding what you actually need. Sometimes you might need a course book, and sometimes all you need is your phone.&nbsp;<br>
</p>
</div>
</div>
</li>
<li data-level="1" data-compare-nr="2" class="rug-media rug-mb js--equal">
<div class="rug-media__img">
<a aria-label="Een kamer vinden in Groningen? Begin hier." href="/education/student-blog/een-kamer-vinden-in-groningen-begin-hier">
<div class="rug-image--placeholder" style="width:105px;height:140px;overflow:hidden;">
<img alt="" data-height="140" data-width="105" class="js--resize" src="/education/student-blog/een-kamer-vinden-in-groningen-begin-hier!attachment?c=images/blog-image-normal.jpg"></div>
</a>
</div>
<div class="rug-media__body">
<div class="rug-text-timid rug-mb-xxs">12 August 2026 - Suzanne</div>
<h3 class="rug-h5">
<a href="/education/student-blog/een-kamer-vinden-in-groningen-begin-hier">Een kamer vinden in Groningen? Begin hier.</a>
</h3>
<div>
<p>Je bent toegelaten en ziet jezelf misschien al door Groningen fietsen, op weg naar je eerste college. Alleen is er nog &eacute;&eacute;n belangrijk detail: een kamer vinden.</p>
</div>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<a href="/education/student-blog/" class="rug-link--caret">More blog entries</a>
</div>
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-layout__column-item">
