</a>
</div>
<div class="rug-media__body">
<h3 class="rug-h5">
<a href="/education/chat-with-our-students">Chat with our students</a>
</h3>
<div>
<div>
                        
<p>Do you have a question about studying at the University of Groningen, about one of our programmes, or about student life in Groningen or Leeuwarden? Send a message to one of our current students!</p>
                     
